        "Pulse holes in shapes #FFD700. (Line 4: #FFFFFF)",
        "Side-by-side comparison of genus counts. (Line 5: #FFFFFF)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section_4",
      "title": "The Famous Application: The Euler Characteristic",
      "lecture_lines": [
        "Euler characteristic is constant.",
        "Formula: Vertices minus edges plus faces.",
        "Always equals two for convex polyhedra."
      ],
      "animations": [
